        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 28024-09, Modern Brass Series Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Towel Bar is available in 4 sizes and 6 popular finish colors that make it a great choice for modern and contemporary bathroom remodels. This Modern Brass Towel Bar is easy to install and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. This bath towel bar is made of solid brass for long-lasting durability against the challenges of a humid bathroom environment.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-toilet-tissue-holder-emtek-2804-09-1214671\"><b>Modern Toilet Tissue Holder</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-brass-6-12-inch-towel-ring-emtek-2801-09-1214738\"><b>Modern Towel Ring</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-double-robe-hook-emtek-2809-09-1214669\"><b>Modern Double Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 24 Inch Bathroom Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Includes: 1 towel bar and all necessary mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-28022-installation.pdf?v=1718159563\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Brass Towel Bar Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-28022-specifications.pdf?v=1718159604\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Brass Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-28024-09:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Dimensions: 5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/8 \"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-28021-09:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Dimensions: 5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/8 \"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-28022-09:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Dimensions: 5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/8 \"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-28023-09:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Dimensions: 5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/8 \"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> \r\n</p>",
